    "One depth job, in and out. Read by services/greenv-depth-runpod/test_handler.py and by",
    "services/greenv-measurement-worker/test/runpod-contract.test.mjs, so the two sides of the",
    "RunPod queue are pinned to one file and cannot drift apart. A change here has to be made",
    "true on both sides in the same commit, or one of the two test suites fails.",
    "Nothing in this file was produced by a GPU: the numbers are illustrative, the SHAs are real",
    "digests of the filler bytes in `service.artifactBytes` so the handler's integrity check is",
    "exercised, and no endpoint has ever been deployed."
